     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tue, Mar 26, 2019 at 8:27 AM Edward Rigdon &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">edward...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Do you have the lavaan package loaded into your workspace?</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Mar 25, 2019 at 2:32 PM Neyrian Fernandes &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">neyrianf...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I am trying to run a cfa in lavaan, but I&#39;am receiving the follow message: </div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:medium none;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><span style=\"color:blue\">HS.model &lt;- &#39; visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">              textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6\r\n</span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">+ </span><span style=\"color:blue\">              speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9&#39;\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre-wrap\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">cfa(HS.model, data=HolzingerSwineford1939)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in file(file, &quot;r&quot;) : cannot open the connection\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addition: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In file(file, &quot;r&quot;) :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> cannot open file &#39; visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3\r\n              textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6\r\n              speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9&#39;: Invalid argument</span></span></pre><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:medium none;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></pre><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:medium none;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></pre><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:medium none;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><font color=\"#000000\">Could anyone help me, please?</font></span></span></pre></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=